 "remarks": "Rarely available and truly one of a kind at The Buckingham! Two expansive units, 7F & 7G, have been seamlessly combined to create nearly 2,900 square feet of exceptionally spacious living in the heart of downtown Stamford. This impressive 3 bedroom, 3 bath residence features beautiful herringbone wood floors, custom millwork and an incredible open living and dining area with plenty of room for entertaining. Two private balconies extend the living space outdoors and offer sweeping views from the seventh floor. The oversized primary suite features a large walk-in closet and private marble bath with walk-in shower, while the generously sized second bedroom offers another walk-in closet and convenient access to a full bath. The flexible layout continues with a third bedroom, separate office, den/family room and multiple spaces that can easily accommodate working from home, guests or hobbies. The updated kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and a breakfast area, complemented by a separate butler's pantry and additional entertaining space. A dedicated laundry room and exceptional storage throughout add even more convenience. Three parking spaces complete this unique offering. The Buckingham provides doorman service, 24 hour security, a clubroom with fireplace and kitchen, fitness room, conference room and outdoor pool, all in a convenient downtown Stamford location close to shopping, dining, entertainment and transportation.",
